<title>JAPAN: HANDBALL-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP PRELIMINARY ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HANDBALL-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP PRELIMINARY ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUMAMOTO, Japan 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of preliminary round matches in the men's handball world championship on Sunday:</p>
<p> Yugoslavia  22  Japan    19</p>
<p> Iceland     27  Algeria  27</p>
<p> France	25  Italy    21</p>
<p> Croatia     34  China    21</p>
<p> Russia	31  Cuba     17</p>
